# "Indestructible": effects that say "destroy" do not destroy it. Show and Tell puts the Colossus onto the battlefield on
# turn 1 (Black Lotus and Mox Sapphire); Bot2 casts a Memnite and then Wrath of God on turn 2 (Black Lotus and Mox
# Pearl). Wrath destroys the Memnite (so it did resolve) but not the Colossus, which is still on the battlefield, undamaged,
# and not in the library or a graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Darksteel Colossus
Show and Tell
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Wrath of God
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Darksteel Colossus)
Bot2.Choose(Island)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Wrath of God.Cast
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Darksteel Colossus
Bot1.Battlefield.Darksteel Colossus.Damage = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Wrath of God; Memnite; Black Lotus
